<template>
  <main class="qva-page qja-page"><header class="qva-hero"><div><span>QGAUSS / IMAGINATION CONTROL</span><h1>为每份想象，<br>安排一间工作室<em>。</em></h1><p>连接、能力、费用与回执，在同一张创作桌上。</p><RouterLink to="/mj">前往 MJ 进阶创作 ↗</RouterLink></div><div class="qva-reel" aria-hidden="true"><i>✦</i><b>FOUR WAYS.<br>ONE IDEA.</b><span>Q / MJ</span></div></header>
    <div v-if="error" class="qva-error" role="alert">{{ error }}<button type="button" @click="load">重新读取</button></div><BrandLoader v-if="loading && !loaded" text="正在打开想象控制台…"/>
    <template v-if="loaded"><section class="qva-overview"><article><small>01 / 创作连接</small><strong>{{ presets.filter(p=>p.enabled).length }} 个已开启</strong><span>保存设置不会发起外部请求</span></article><article><small>02 / 正在显影</small><strong>{{ receipts.filter(mjActive).length }} 份想象</strong><span>已取得编号后只续查原任务</span></article><article><small>03 / 次数纪律</small><strong>确认，再开始</strong><span>作品完整保存后结算，未完成释放预留</span></article></section>
    <section class="qva-panel"><header><div><span>THE IMAGINATION DESK</span><h2>一条连接，承接更多可能</h2><p>使用已有加密渠道，按实际服务开放能力。</p></div><button class="qva-secondary" type="button" :disabled="saving" @click="add">＋ 添加创作连接</button></header><div class="qva-presets"><button v-for="p in presets" :key="p.id" type="button" :aria-pressed="selectedId===p.id" :disabled="saving" @click="edit(p)"><b>{{ p.name }}</b><small>{{ p.enabled?'已开启':'未开启' }} · {{ p.speed }}</small></button><span v-if="!presets.length">还没有 MJ 连接，先添加一条。</span></div>
      <form v-if="draft" @submit.prevent="save"><div class="qva-form"><label>前台名称<input v-model="draft.name" aria-label="MJ 连接名称" maxlength="60" required/></label><label>原生协议<select v-model="draft.profile" aria-label="MJ 原生协议"><option value="PLUS">Plus 兼容协议</option><option value="PROXY">开源 Proxy 兼容协议</option></select><small>返回码 21 在两种协议中含义不同，必须与服务一致。</small></label><label>已有加密渠道<select v-model="draft.channelId" aria-label="MJ 加密渠道"><option value="">暂未选择</option><option v-for="c in channels" :key="c.id" :value="c.id" :disabled="!c.enabled">{{ c.name }}{{ c.enabled?'':' · 未开启' }}</option></select><small>继续复用渠道中的密钥，不在任务中保存明文。</small></label><label>渠道验证方式<select v-model="draft.authMode" aria-label="MJ 验证方式"><option value="MJ_SECRET">mj-api-secret</option><option value="BEARER">Authorization Bearer</option></select></label><label>创作速度<select v-model="draft.speed" aria-label="MJ 创作速度"><option value="fast">快速 Fast</option><option value="relax">悠闲 Relax</option><option value="turbo">加速 Turbo</option></select><small>可分别配置不同速度的连接与价格。</small></label><label>最长等待（分钟）<input v-model.number="draft.maxWaitMinutes" aria-label="MJ 最长等待" type="number" min="2" max="120" required/></label><label>扣减次数池<select v-model="draft.pool" aria-label="MJ 次数池"><option v-for="(name,key) in mjPools" :key="key" :value="key">{{ name }}</option></select></label><label>融合图片上限<select v-model.number="draft.blendLimit" aria-label="MJ 融合上限"><option :value="5">5 张 · 常用兼容范围</option><option :value="6">6 张 · 仅对已确认支持的连接开放</option></select></label></div>
      <fieldset class="qja-capabilities"><legend>按实际服务开放能力</legend><div><label v-for="version in versions" :key="version"><input v-model="draft.versions" type="checkbox" :value="version"/>Midjourney {{ version }}</label></div><div><label><input v-model="draft.niji" type="checkbox"/>Niji Journey 6</label><label><input v-model="draft.faceSwap" type="checkbox"/>人物合成</label><label><input v-model="draft.video" type="checkbox"/>原生短片、首尾帧与续写</label></div><p>原生动作仅在服务返回相应按钮后显示。版本与能力的真实可用性需要联调确认。</p></fieldset>
      <fieldset class="qja-prices"><legend>每种创作，分别定价</legend><div class="qva-form"><label v-for="item in priceKeys" :key="item.key">{{ item.name }} 基础次数<input v-model.number="draft.prices[item.key]" type="number" min="0" max="1000000" :aria-label="'MJ '+item.name+' 次数'" required/></label><label>HD 次数倍率<input v-model.number="draft.hdMultiplier" aria-label="MJ HD 次数倍率" type="number" min="1" max="10" required/></label><label>高运动次数倍率<input v-model.number="draft.highMotionMultiplier" aria-label="MJ 高运动次数倍率" type="number" min="1" max="10" required/></label></div><p>首次文字成画按画质倍数计费并向上取整，HD 再乘所设倍率；后续图片操作使用各自基础次数。短片按请求片段数计费，720p 和高运动分别追加倍率。每次开始前都会核对并展示最终次数。关闭商业化或启用演示站时不扣次数。</p></fieldset>
      <div class="qva-form-foot"><label><input v-model="draft.enabled" type="checkbox" aria-label="开启 MJ 连接"/>开启这条创作连接</label><div><span>版本 {{ draft.version }} · 保存不出网</span><button type="submit" class="qva-primary" :disabled="saving">{{ saving?'保存中…':'保存这条连接' }}</button></div></div></form><div v-else class="qva-empty">选择已有连接，或添加第一条创作连接。</div></section>
    <section class="qva-panel"><header><div><span>EVERY IDEA HAS A RECEIPT</span><h2>创作回执</h2><p>核对原编号、状态与次数处理。</p></div><button class="qva-secondary" type="button" :disabled="refreshing" @click="loadReceipts">{{ refreshing?'读取中…':'刷新回执' }}</button></header><div v-if="receiptError" class="qva-error" role="alert">{{ receiptError }}</div><div v-else-if="!receipts.length" class="qva-empty">工作室还很安静。第一份想象开始后，回执会出现在这里。</div><div v-else class="qva-receipts"><article v-for="t in receipts" :key="t.id"><div class="qva-receipt-icon">✦</div><div class="qva-receipt-copy"><strong>{{ t.presetName }} <small>{{ t.kindName }}</small></strong><p>{{ t.prompt }}</p><span>{{ mjStatus(t.status) }} · {{ date(t.createdAt) }}</span><small v-if="t.upstreamId">外部任务 {{ t.upstreamId }}</small><small>{{ t.message }}</small><small v-if="t.remoteCancelState && t.remoteCancelState!=='NONE'">外部取消回执：{{ remoteStates[t.remoteCancelState] || t.remoteCancelState }}</small></div><div v-if="t.billing" class="qva-receipt-bill"><b>结算 {{ t.billing.charged }} 次</b><span>预留 {{ t.billing.reserved }} · 释放 {{ t.billing.returned }}</span><small v-if="t.billing.expired">到期失效 {{ t.billing.expired }}</small><button v-if="['POLLING','SAVING','SETTLING'].includes(t.status)" type="button" :disabled="checking.has(t.id)" @click="checkAgain(t)">{{ checking.has(t.id)?'安排中…':'再查一次' }}</button></div></article></div></section></template>
  </main>
</template>
<script setup>
import {onMounted,onUnmounted,reactive,ref,watch} from 'vue';
import {RouterLink} from 'vue-router';
import {ElMessage} from 'element-plus';
import {api} from '../../api/client.js';
import {useAuth} from '../../stores/auth.js';
import {mjActive,mjPools,mjStatus} from '../../lib/midjourney-presentation.js';
import BrandLoader from '../../components/design/BrandLoader.vue';
import '../../components/design/video-control.css';
const versions=['5.2','6','6.1','7','8.1','8.2'],keys=['imagine','blend','describe','shorten','swap','upscale','variation','reroll','pan','outpaint','inpaint','video','video_extend'];
const remoteStates={REQUESTED:'待请求',PROCESSING:'正在请求',ACKNOWLEDGED:'服务已接收取消请求',UNCONFIRMED:'结果未确认，没有自动重发',UNSUPPORTED:'原服务未开放取消',LOCAL_ONLY:'仅停止站内等待'};
const auth=useAuth(),owner=auth.user?.id,presets=ref([]),channels=ref([]),priceKeys=ref([]),receipts=ref([]),selectedId=ref(''),draft=ref(null),error=ref(''),receiptError=ref(''),loading=ref(false),loaded=ref(false),saving=ref(false),refreshing=ref(false),checking=reactive(new Set());
let alive=true;const requests=new Map(),current=()=>alive&&auth.isAdmin&&auth.user?.id===owner;
function scope(key){requests.get(key)?.abort();const c=new AbortController();requests.set(key,c);return{signal:c.signal,current:()=>current()&&!c.signal.aborted&&requests.get(key)===c};}
function edit(p){selectedId.value=p.id;draft.value=JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(p));}
function add(){selectedId.value='';draft.value={name:'新的想象工作室',profile:'PLUS',authMode:'MJ_SECRET',speed:'fast',channelId:'',enabled:false,pool:'drawMj',maxWaitMinutes:30,prices:Object.fromEntries(keys.map(k=>[k,0])),versions:['7'],video:false,faceSwap:false,niji:true,blendLimit:5,hdMultiplier:2,highMotionMultiplier:2,version:0};}
async function load(){if(saving.value)return;const req=scope('config');loading.value=true;error.value='';try{const data=await api.get('/mj/admin/config',{signal:req.signal});if(!req.current())return;presets.value=data.presets||[];channels.value=data.channels||[];priceKeys.value=data.priceKeys||[];loaded.value=true;const selected=presets.value.find(p=>p.id===selectedId.value)||presets.value[0];if(selected)edit(selected);else draft.value=null;await loadReceipts();}catch(e){if(req.current())error.value=e.message||'创作配置暂未读取';}finally{if(req.current())loading.value=false;}}
async function save(){if(!draft.value||saving.value)return;if(!draft.value.versions.length)return ElMessage.warning('至少开放一个模型版本');const req=scope('save');saving.value=true;error.value='';const value=Object.fromEntries(['name','profile','authMode','speed','channelId','enabled','pool','maxWaitMinutes','prices','versions','video','faceSwap','niji','blendLimit','hdMultiplier','highMotionMultiplier','version'].map(k=>[k,draft.value[k]]));try{const saved=selectedId.value?await api.put('/mj/admin/presets/'+selectedId.value,value,{signal:req.signal}):await api.post('/mj/admin/presets',value,{signal:req.signal});if(!req.current())return;const i=presets.value.findIndex(p=>p.id===saved.id);if(i<0)presets.value.push(saved);else presets.value[i]=saved;edit(saved);ElMessage.success('创作连接已保存，没有发起生成。');}catch(e){if(req.current())error.value=e.status===409?'这条连接已更新，请重新读取后编辑。':e.message;}finally{if(req.current())saving.value=false;}}
async function loadReceipts(){const req=scope('receipts');refreshing.value=true;receiptError.value='';try{const data=await api.get('/mj/admin/receipts',{signal:req.signal});if(req.current())receipts.value=data.items||[];}catch(e){if(req.current())receiptError.value=e.message||'回执暂未读取';}finally{if(req.current())refreshing.value=false;}}
async function checkAgain(task){if(checking.has(task.id))return;checking.add(task.id);try{await api.post('/mj/admin/tasks/'+task.id+'/check');if(current()){ElMessage.success('已安排核对原任务。');await loadReceipts();}}catch(e){if(current())receiptError.value=e.message;}finally{if(current())checking.delete(task.id);}}
const date=v=>v?new Date(v).toLocaleString('zh-CN',{hour12:false}):'';
function close(){alive=false;for(const c of requests.values())c.abort();draft.value=null;receipts.value=[];}
watch(()=>auth.user?.id,id=>{if(id!==owner)close();});onMounted(load);onUnmounted(close);
</script>
<style scoped>
.qja-capabilities,.qja-prices{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,currentColor 13%,transparent);border-radius:22px;padding:22px;margin:24px 0}.qja-capabilities legend,.qja-prices legend{font-weight:750;padding:0 12px}.qja-capabilities>div{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 24px}.qja-capabilities label{min-height:44px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;font-size:13px}.qja-capabilities p,.qja-prices p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.85;opacity:.65;margin-bottom:0}.qja-capabilities input{accent-color:#9470f6;width:18px;height:18px}.qja-page .qva-reel{transform:rotate(10deg)}@media(max-width:800px){.qja-capabilities,.qja-prices{padding:16px}.qja-page .qva-panel>header{flex-direction:column;align-items:stretch}.qja-page .qva-panel>header>.qva-secondary{align-self:flex-start}.qja-page :is(input,select,button){font-size:16px;min-height:48px}.qja-capabilities label input{min-height:20px}}
</style>
